sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Laptop (Ctrl Script)
  participant P as Pi (Mgmt Script)
  participant C as Cube (Lua + ArduPilot)
  participant B as Power board
  B-->>P: CHARGE_STATUS (docked, charging) 1 Hz
  B-->>C: CHARGE_STATUS (same broadcast)
  P->>L: GET /next_mission (every 10 s)
  L-->>P: mission (ID, waypoints, capture points)
  P->>P: preflight checks
  loop each waypoint
    P->>C: MISSION_ITEM
    C-->>P: CMD_ACK
  end
  P->>B: CHARGE_CMD stop
  B-->>P: CHARGE_STATUS contacts_live = 0
  P->>C: DRONE_CMD ARM
  C-->>P: CMD_ACK ok (interlock passed)
  P->>C: DRONE_CMD START_MISSION
  loop survey
    C-->>P: DRONE_STATE 10 Hz
    P->>P: capture + geotag at each waypoint
  end
  P->>C: DRONE_CMD RTL
  P->>C: DRONE_CMD LAND (precision descent)
  loop docking
    P->>C: LAND_TARGET ~10 Hz (tag offsets)
  end
  C-->>P: DRONE_STATE landed, disarmed
  B-->>P: CHARGE_STATUS docked = 1
  P->>B: CHARGE_CMD start
  P->>L: POST /upload/manifest (mission ID, images + SHA-256)
  loop each image
    P->>L: POST /upload (image + sidecar)
    L-->>P: ack if SHA-256 matches, else re-send
  end
  L-->>P: mission COMPLETE (all verified)
  P->>P: delete local copies
  Note over L: images handed to the separate<br/>shoreline analysis app
